docs {
  A synthetic NAB export (apps/api/tests/fixtures/nab/pending-then-posted.csv)
  staged on account A, reviewed row by row, classified and cancelled; staged
  again and confirmed with every row ignored, so the ledger gets nothing. The
  account's deletion in the teardown takes the batches with it.
}
